        <Dirtmole MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.05</Dirtmole>
        <Neanderthal MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.03</Neanderthal>
        <Waster MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">0.02</Waster>
        <Stoneborn MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,det.stoneborn">0.03</Stoneborn>
        <DV_Bogleg MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,det.boglegs">0.02</DV_Bogleg>
        <Korg MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,sovereign.kork">0.02</Korg>
        <Gorilla MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,onlymonkey.awakenedapes">0.02</Gorilla>
      </xenotypeChances>
    </xenotypeSet>
    <fixedIdeo>true</fixedIdeo>
    <ideoName>The Union Book</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>The ground keeps what it is given, and the union goes down together to ask for it back. Every member and every shift is written in the book, nobody decides alone, and a strike is called only by vote. Work is the whole of the faith: a seam worked well, a shaft shored right, everyone up again at the end of the shift. When the seam under Deepwell ran dry and the owners fled, Marta Grieve put it to the vote in the hall, and the miners chose to stay together, so the book's first page is that vote and every name under it.</ideoDescription>
    <forcedMemes>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Collectivist</li>
      <!-- Those who go down into the ground: Ideology's tunnellers. -->
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Tunneler</li>
      <!-- The work is the faith: Vanilla Ideology Expanded's industrialism. -->
